---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy | HUMANITY"
  description="Privacy and data-processing disclosure for the HUMANITY public website."
>
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <header class="border-b border-humanity-border pb-7">
      <p class="eyebrow">Transparency</p>
      <h1 class="editorial-title mt-3 text-4xl font-semibold sm:text-5xl">
        Privacy notice
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-humanity-textMuted">
        Engineering disclosure draft · Requires owner and legal review
      </p>
    </header>
    <div
      class="prose-copy max-w-3xl space-y-7 py-8 leading-relaxed text-humanity-textMuted"
    >
      <section>
        <h2 class="editorial-title text-2xl font-semibold text-humanity-text">
          Public website
        </h2><p class="mt-3">
          The reviewed application contains no first-party accounts, login,
          payment, advertising, or analytics feature. The site requests
          published data feeds and, when a map is opened, map tiles from
          OpenStreetMap. The host and tile provider may receive standard
          connection data such as IP address, browser information, requested
          URL, and request time under their own policies. HUMANITY does not
          control their logs or retention.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="editorial-title text-2xl font-semibold text-humanity-text">
          Source and event data
        </h2><p class="mt-3">
          Ingestion processes public-source metadata and may retrieve feed, API,
          or article-page text for extraction. Source records are persisted for
          pipeline processing. Public event records may contain locations,
          source links, and short attributed claim excerpts. Source access is
          not permission to retain or republish content. Source-specific rights
          and retention review remains pending in the <a
            class="link"
            href="/source-rights">source-rights register</a
          >.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="editorial-title text-2xl font-semibold text-humanity-text">
          Questions and corrections
        </h2><p class="mt-3">
          There is no private account or in-product request form. Use the <a
            class="link"
            href="https://github.com/asdfhgds/humanity/issues"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer">public issue tracker</a
          > for privacy questions or corrections; do not post sensitive personal information
          publicly. It is not an emergency contact.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="editorial-title text-2xl font-semibold text-humanity-text">
          Scope and updates
        </h2><p class="mt-3">
          This draft reflects the application code reviewed for this release and
          does not independently verify host settings. The project owner should
          confirm cookies, provider logging, retention, security, and legal
          requirements before relying on it. If accounts, analytics, alerts, or
          paid services are added, update this notice before enabling them.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
    <p
      class="border-t border-humanity-border pt-5 text-xs text-humanity-textMuted"
    >
      This notice is an engineering disclosure, not legal advice or a promise
      that third-party providers retain no data.
    </p>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
